TITLE: Basic JADX Command-Line Usage Examples
DESCRIPTION: Provides common command-line examples for using JADX, demonstrating how to decompile a DEX file to an output directory, set different rename flags (none, valid, printable), and control the logging level for operations.

SOURCE: https://github.com/skylot/jadx/blob/master/README.md#_snippet_11

LANGUAGE: Shell
CODE:
```
jadx -d out classes.dex
jadx --rename-flags "none" classes.dex
jadx --rename-flags "valid, printable" classes.dex
jadx --log-level ERROR app.apk
jadx -Pdex-input.verify-checksum=no app.apk
```

