","workspace_file_chunks":[]},{"status":"success","request_id":"7316d8b9-08c2-4e74-9d81-f6a1cd6b6758","request_message":"","structured_output_nodes":[{"id":1,"type":5,"content":"","tool_use":{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013KrMiGuEDFC3swQPQhhggk","tool_name":"str-replace-editor","input_json":"{"instruction_reminder": "ALWAYS BREAK DOWN EDITS INTO SMALLER CHUNKS OF AT MOST 150 LINES EACH.", "command": "str_replace", "path": "app-server/src/main/java/com/github/kirer/app_server/MainActivity.kt", "old_str": " @SuppressLint(\"UseKtx\", \"SetTextI18n\")\n private fun displayScreenshot(data: ByteArray, size: Int) {\n try {\n // RAW\u683c\u5f0f\u9700\u8981\u7279\u6b8a\u5904\u7406 - \u52a8\u6001\u83b7\u53d6\u5c4f\u5e55\u5206\u8fa8\u7387\n val displayMetrics = resources.displayMetrics\n val width = displayMetrics.widthPixels\n val height = displayMetrics.heightPixels\n val expectedSize = width * height * 4 // RGBA = 4 bytes per pixel\n addLog(\"\u5c4f\u5e55\u5206\u8fa8\u7387: ${width}x${height}, \u671f\u671b\u6570\u636e\u5927\u5c0f: $expectedSize, \u5b9e\u9645\u6570\u636e\u5927\u5c0f: ${data.size}\")\n // \u521b\u5efaBitmap\u5e76\u8bbe\u7f6e\u50cf\u7d20\u6570\u636e\n val bitmap = Bitmap.createBitmap(width, height, Bitmap.Config.ARGB_8888)\n val buffer = java.nio.ByteBuffer.wrap(data)\n bitmap.copyPixelsFromBuffer(buffer)\n binding.ivScreenshot.setImageBitmap(bitmap)\n val sizeText = formatFileSize(size)\n binding.tvImageInfo.text = \"\u5927\u5c0f: $sizeText, \u5206\u8fa8\u7387: ${width}x${height}\"\n addLog(\"RAW\u622a\u56fe\u663e\u793a\u6210\u529f: ${width}x${height}, $sizeText\")\n } catch (e: Exception) {\n addLog(\"\u663e\u793a\u622a\u56fe\u65f6\u51fa\u9519: ${e.message}\")\n }\n }", "new_str": " @SuppressLint(\"UseKtx\", \"SetTextI18n\")\n private fun displayScreenshot(data: ByteArray, size: Int) {\n try {\n // \u68c0\u6d4b\u6570\u636e\u683c\u5f0f\n val isPng = data.size >= 8 && \n data[0] == 0x89.toByte() && data[1] == 0x50.toByte() && \n data[2] == 0x4E.toByte() && data[3] == 0x47.toByte()\n \n val displayMetrics = resources.displayMetrics\n val screenWidth = displayMetrics.widthPixels\n val screenHeight = displayMetrics.heightPixels\n val expectedRawSize = screenWidth * screenHeight * 4 // RGBA = 4 bytes per pixel\n \n addLog(\"\u5c4f\u5e55\u5206\u8fa8\u7387: ${screenWidth}x${screenHeight}, \u671f\u671bRAW\u5927\u5c0f: $expectedRawSize, \u5b9e\u9645\u6570\u636e\u5927\u5c0f: ${data.size}\")\n addLog(\"\u6570\u636e\u683c\u5f0f\u68c0\u6d4b: ${if (isPng) \"PNG\" else \"\u53ef\u80fd\u662fRAW\"}\")\n \n val bitmap = if (isPng) {\n // PNG\u683c\u5f0f\uff1a\u4f7f\u7528\u6807\u51c6\u89e3\u7801\n addLog(\"\u4f7f\u7528PNG\u89e3\u7801\")\n BitmapFactory.decodeByteArray(data, 0, data.size)\n } else if (data.size == expectedRawSize) {\n // RAW\u683c\u5f0f\uff1a\u6570\u636e\u5927\u5c0f\u5339\u914d\u5c4f\u5e55\u5206\u8fa8\u7387\n addLog(\"\u4f7f\u7528RAW\u89e3\u7801\uff08\u5c4f\u5e55\u5206\u8fa8\u7387\uff09\")\n val bitmap = Bitmap.createBitmap(screenWidth, screenHeight, Bitmap.Config.ARGB_8888)\n val buffer = java.nio.ByteBuffer.wrap(data)\n bitmap.copyPixelsFromBuffer(buffer)\n bitmap\n } else {\n // RAW\u683c\u5f0f\uff1a\u5c1d\u8bd5\u63a8\u6d4b\u5206\u8fa8\u7387\n val pixelCount = data.size / 4\n addLog(\"\u5c1d\u8bd5\u63a8\u6d4bRAW\u5206\u8fa8\u7387\uff0c\u50cf\u7d20\u6570: $pixelCount\")\n \n // \u5c1d\u8bd5\u5e38\u89c1\u5206\u8fa8\u7387\n val possibleResolutions = listOf(\n Pair(1080, 2400), Pair(1080, 2340), Pair(1080, 1920),\n Pair(1440, 3200), Pair(1440, 2960), Pair(720, 1600)\n )\n \n var bitmap: Bitmap? = null\n for ((w, h) in possibleResolutions) {\n if (w * h == pixelCount) {\n addLog(\"\u63a8\u6d4b\u5206\u8fa8\u7387: ${w}x${h}\")\n bitmap = Bitmap.createBitmap(w, h, Bitmap.Config.ARGB_8888)\n val buffer = java.nio.ByteBuffer.wrap(data)\n bitmap.copyPixelsFromBuffer(buffer)\n break\n }\n }\n bitmap\n }\n \n if (bitmap != null) {\n binding.ivScreenshot.setImageBitmap(bitmap)\n val sizeText = formatFileSize(size)\n binding.tvImageInfo.text = \"\u5927\u5c0f: $sizeText, \u5206\u8fa8\u7387: ${bitmap.width}x${bitmap.height}\"\n addLog(\"\u622a\u56fe\u663e\u793a\u6210\u529f: ${bitmap.width}x${bitmap.height}, $sizeText\")\n } else {\n addLog(\"\u65e0\u6cd5\u89e3\u7801\u622a\u56fe\u6570\u636e\")\n }\n } catch (e: Exception) {\n addLog(\"\u663e\u793a\u622a\u56fe\u65f6\u51fa\u9519: ${e.message}\")\n }\n }", "old_str_start_line_number": 416, "old_str_end_line_number": 436}","mcp_server_name":"","mcp_tool_name":""}},{"id":2,"type":0,"content":"我看到了问题！在 `displayScreenshot` 方法中，你简化了代码，但是有一个关键问题：

**问题分析：**

1. **第427行：** `val buffer = java.nio.ByteBuffer.wrap(data)`
2. **第428行：** `bitmap.copyPixelsFromBuffer(buffer)`

**"Buffer not large enough" 错误的原因：**

从之前的日志我们知道，server-adb-shell 返回的是 **PNG 格式数据**（100651 bytes），但是你的代码假设它是 **RAW 格式数据**，并尝试用屏幕分辨率来创建 Bitmap。

- **屏幕分辨率：** 比如 1080x2400
- **期望的RAW数据大小：** 1080 × 2400 × 4 = 10,368,000 bytes 
- **实际PNG数据大小：** 100,651 bytes

当 `copyPixelsFromBuffer` 尝试从 100,651 字节的 buffer 中读取 10,368,000 字节的数据时，就会报 "Buffer not large enough" 错误。

**解决方案：**

我们需要先检测数据格式，然后用正确的方式处理：
